#: ../../source/guide/advanced_structures/skip_list.rst:14
#: f6f8ab6f0cf04285a2a11be87590b0f1
msgid ""
"A **Skip List** is a probabilistic alternative to balanced trees. It "
"maintains a sorted linked list (level 0) augmented with several express-"
"lane linked lists, enabling O(log n) average-case search, insertion, and "
"deletion without deterministic rotations or rebalancing."
msgstr ""

